This repository contains no third-party source code. The components below are
installed by pip or used as tools; each stays under its own licence.

Runtime dependency
- relate-db 1.0.1 (Relate, the embedded graph database by Neo4j Labs), Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/relatedb/relate
  Its wheel bundles 153 open-source components (Rust crates). Its own SBOM
  (relate_db-1.0.1.dist-info/sboms/relate-python.cyclonedx.json) lists their licences,
  all permissive: MIT, Apache-2.0 (some with the LLVM exception), BSD-2-Clause,
  BSD-3-Clause, Zlib, BSL-1.0, Unlicense, CC0-1.0, Unicode-3.0
  (licence scan run 13 Nov 2026; no copyleft licence found).

Tests and packaging (not needed to run the tool)
- pytest, MIT License.
- setuptools, MIT License.

Demo video (demo/offboarding-graph-demo.mp4) was made with
- Playwright (Apache License 2.0) driving Chromium (BSD-style licences), and ffmpeg
  (LGPL/GPL), used as tools only; none of their code is in this repository.
- Narration: AI-generated voice (ElevenLabs text-to-speech, stock voice).
- No third-party music, images, logos or datasets.

Demo data (demo/exports, demo/offboarding.rl) is invented: every person, email address,
tool name ("Docs", "Chat", "Tracker", "Wiki", "CodeHost") and price is made up.
